## Backend local environment
##
## Copy to `Backend/.env` (this file is gitignored) and adjust as needed.

# Keep this stable across backend restarts to avoid invalidating local dev JWTs.
JWT_SECRET=enterprise-app-dev-secret-key-change-in-production

# LiveKit Cloud credentials used for audio/video calls.
LIVEKIT_URL=wss://your-project.livekit.cloud
LIVEKIT_API_KEY=your-livekit-api-key
LIVEKIT_API_SECRET=your-livekit-api-secret
